# SkyIsland2MissionDetail
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制、貴船の進入を確認した。<br>ようこそ、ディアデム諸島へ！
#. de: Hier Kommandozentrale Haillenarte. An das eingetroffene Luftschiff: Willkommen auf dem Diadem!
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Position de votre aéronef confirmée sur nos radars. Bienvenue dans l'archipel du Diadème<nbsp>!
#. column 9: House Haillenarte has a vested interest in the bounty these isles have to offer. As such, your task this day is to assess the region's natural resources.
#. column 10: Go forth and gather what you may! Provide us with a thorough evaluation, and your diligence shall be duly rewarded. 
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:10:0:8"
msgid "This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 冒険者諸君には、ディアデム諸島の資源調査を依頼したい。<br>心赴くままに採集活動を行い、成果を報告してくれ。
#. de: Das Haus Haillenarte bittet die Besatzung des Luftschiffs, bei der Evaluierung vorhandener Ressourcen zu assistieren. Sammelt dazu Rohstoffproben nach eigenem Ermessen.
#. fr: Procédez à l'exploration de l'archipel en récoltant un maximum de ressources. Les données que vous enverrez seront analysées directement par nos scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ques.
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 10: Go forth and gather what you may! Provide us with a thorough evaluation, and your diligence shall be duly rewarded. 
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:10:0:9"
msgid "House Haillenarte has a vested interest in the bounty these isles have to offer. As such, your task this day is to assess the region's natural resources."
msgstr ""

#. ja: むろん、規程の活動を行えば、相応の報酬を贈ろう。<br>それでは、よい探索を……！
#. de: Das Haus zahlt im Gegenzug natürlich eine fürstliche Belohnung. Auf gute Zusammenarbeit!
#. fr: Bien sûr, nous vous récompenserons en fonction de votre con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion. Vous avez tout intérêt à redoubler d'activité<nbsp>! Bonne chance, et que la bénédiction de Halone soit avec vous.
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 9: House Haillenarte has a vested interest in the bounty these isles have to offer. As such, your task this day is to assess the region's natural resources.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:10:0:10"
msgid "Go forth and gather what you may! Provide us with a thorough evaluation, and your diligence shall be duly rewarded. "
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制……<br>資源調査の第一段階完了を確認した。
#. de: Hier Kommandozentrale Haillenarte. Wir bestätigen den Abschluss der ersten Etappe der Probengewinnung.
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Première partie de l'analyse des ressources terminée.
#. column 9: The initial results are certainly promising! Pray continue your survey and inform us of your progress.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:11:0:8"
msgid "Operation Command here.<br>We have received your preliminary report."
msgstr ""

#. ja: なかなか興味深い、活動結果が出たようだな。<br>それでは、引き続き資源調査を続行してくれたまえ。
#. de: Die ersten Ergebnisse sehen viel<shy>ver<shy>sprechend aus. Viel Erfolg bei der nächsten Etappe!
#. fr: Les résultats obtenus sont très prometteurs. Veuillez poursuivre votre exploration du Diadème en récoltant un maximum de ressources.
#. column 8: Operation Command here.<br>We have received your preliminary report.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:11:0:9"
msgid "The initial results are certainly promising! Pray continue your survey and inform us of your progress."
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制……<br>資源調査の第二段階完了を確認した。
#. de: Hier Kommandozentrale Haillenarte. Wir bestätigen den Abschluss der zweiten Etappe der Probengewinnung.
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Seconde partie de l'analyse des ressources terminée.
#. column 9: Fascinating, but inconclusive. One last round of samples should allow for a more definitive assessment!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:12:0:8"
msgid "Operation Command here.<br>We have received your interim report."
msgstr ""

#. ja: この調子で、最後まで資源調査を続けてくれ。
#. de: Eure Ausbeute kann sich sehen lassen. Bringt jetzt den Einsatz zu Ende!
#. fr: Les données que vous nous fournissez sont toujours aussi in<shy>té<shy>res<shy>santes. Veuillez poursuivre la mission d'exploration et récolter autant de matériaux que possible<nbsp>!
#. column 8: Operation Command here.<br>We have received your interim report.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:12:0:9"
msgid "Fascinating, but inconclusive. One last round of samples should allow for a more definitive assessment!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 過属性ファイアクリスタルを収集
#. de: Überladene Feuerkristalle sammeln
#. fr: Rassembler des cristaux de feu surchargés
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 9: Your task this day is to gather crystals that exhibit excessive elemental properties. Proceed to the delineated area, and secure the shards we seek.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:13:0:7"
msgid "Gather over-aspected fire crystals"
msgstr ""

