msgid "Gather your last haul of goods and deliver what you have to the <i>Bounty</i>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 諸君たちの協力に感謝する。<br>報酬は、漂着地で受渡をさせてもらうぞ！
#. de: Das Haus Haillenarte dankt euch für eure Hilfe. Ihr habt einen großen Dienst geleistet. Der Pilot wurde angewiesen, euch eure Belohnung auszuhändigen.
#. fr: Merci pour votre col<shy>la<shy>bo<shy>ra<shy>tion<nbsp>! Vous pouvez venir recevoir votre récompense à bord de La Bonté.
#. column 7: Deliver gathered goods to the pilot at the <i>Bounty</i>
#. column 8: Operation Command here.<br>We have received your interim report.
#. column 9: Gather your last haul of goods and deliver what you have to the <i>Bounty</i>.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:25:0:10"
msgid "I promise you House Haillenarte will not be miserly with its gratitude!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 誘引香の罠で「シルバーシェル」を誘き寄せて倒し、<br>「雲海種の器官標本」を収集
#. de: Silberschalen anlocken und Organproben entnehmen
#. fr: Attirer des coquargents grâce à un piège olfactif puis les vaincre pour obtenir leurs glandes
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 9: Your task this day will be to secure specimens for our House Haillenarte naturalists. Set a trap to lure the creatures in question, then slay them as cleanly as possible.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:26:0:7"
msgid "Use a scent trap to ambush silvershells, and obtain cloud dweller organs"
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制、貴船の進入を確認した。<br>ようこそ、ディアデム諸島へ！
#. de: Hier Kommandozentrale Haillenarte. An das eingetroffene Luftschiff: Willkommen auf dem Diadem!
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Position de votre aéronef confirmée sur nos radars. Bienvenue dans l'archipel du Diadème<nbsp>!
#. column 7: Use a scent trap to ambush silvershells, and obtain cloud dweller organs
#. column 9: Your task this day will be to secure specimens for our House Haillenarte naturalists. Set a trap to lure the creatures in question, then slay them as cleanly as possible.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:26:0:8"
msgid "This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 冒険者諸君には、博物学研究に必要な標本の採取を依頼したい。<br>「誘引香の罠」を用いて対象生物を誘き寄せ、速やかに倒してくれ。
#. de: Das Haus Haillenarte bittet die Besatzung des Luftschiffs, bei der Beschaffung von Organproben zu assistieren. Lockt dazu das bezeichnete Ungeheuer mit einer Duftfalle an und erschlagt es!
#. fr: Nous avons besoin d'échan<shy>til<shy>lons pour étudier les espèces vivant dans l'archipel. Veuillez attirer les cibles grâce à un piège olfactif puis les abattre pour prélever leurs glandes.
#. column 7: Use a scent trap to ambush silvershells, and obtain cloud dweller organs
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:26:0:9"
msgid "Your task this day will be to secure specimens for our House Haillenarte naturalists. Set a trap to lure the creatures in question, then slay them as cleanly as possible."
msgstr ""

#. ja: また、任務の過程では、「活動評価」を指針として、周辺の探索も進めてもらいたい。
