#. ja: バウンティ号の漂着地のアインハルト家の飛空士に収集物を納品
#. de: Ressourcen beim Piloten der <i>Bounty</i> abliefern
#. fr: Apporter les échan<shy>til<shy>lons au pilote des Haillenarte,<br>sur La Bonté
#. column 8: Operation Command here.<br>We have received your interim report.
#. column 9: Gather your last haul of goods and deliver what you have to the <i>Bounty</i>.
#. column 10: I promise you House Haillenarte will not be miserly with its gratitude!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:36:0:7"
msgid "Deliver gathered goods to the pilot at the <i>Bounty</i>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制……<br>探索任務の第二段階完了を確認した。
#. de: Hier Kommandozentrale Haillenarte. Wir bestätigen den Abschluss der zweiten Etappe der Expedition.
