#. ja: 「古代種の卵」を回収地点に運ぶ
#. de: Ur-Ei abliefern
#. fr: Apporter l'œuf primitif à l'endroit indiqué
#. column 8: With the mice slain, it is time to search for the real prize: the egg of a dinosaur.
#. column 9: Once you have secured the egg, carry it as swiftly as possible to the designated collection point.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:47:0:7"
msgid "Carry the dinosaur egg to the collection point"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ネズミどもを始末したら、周辺に卵がないか確認してくれ。
#. de: Die Dottermäuse sind beseitigt. Sichert nun das Ei!
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Une fois les rongeurs éliminés, localisez l'œuf primitif.
#. column 7: Carry the dinosaur egg to the collection point
#. column 9: Once you have secured the egg, carry it as swiftly as possible to the designated collection point.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:47:0:8"
msgid "With the mice slain, it is time to search for the real prize: the egg of a dinosaur."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「古代種の卵」を発見したら、<br>これを回収地点まで運搬してもらいたい。
#. de: Sammelt das Ur-Ei ein und bringt es wohlbehalten zum Sammelpunkt.
#. fr: Lorsque vous aurez ramassé l'œuf primitif, il vous suffira de nous le livrer à l'endroit indiqué.
#. column 7: Carry the dinosaur egg to the collection point
#. column 8: With the mice slain, it is time to search for the real prize: the egg of a dinosaur.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:47:0:9"
msgid "Once you have secured the egg, carry it as swiftly as possible to the designated collection point."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「クラウドトラップ」を倒し、「雲海妖花の花粉」を収集
#. de: Wolkenfallen besiegen und Pollen erbeuten
#. fr: Éliminer des piège-nuages et obtenir leur pollen
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 9: House Haillenarte is on the lookout for unique-smelling substances─your first task will be to harvest pollen from the region's cloudtraps.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:48:0:7"
msgid "Slay cloudtraps and obtain cloudblossom pollen"
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制、貴船の進入を確認した。<br>ようこそ、ディアデム諸島へ！
#. de: Hier Kommandozentrale Haillenarte. An das eingetroffene Luftschiff: Willkommen auf dem Diadem!
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Position de votre aéronef confirmée sur nos radars. Bienvenue dans l'archipel du Diadème<nbsp>!
#. column 7: Slay cloudtraps and obtain cloudblossom pollen
#. column 9: House Haillenarte is on the lookout for unique-smelling substances─your first task will be to harvest pollen from the region's cloudtraps.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:48:0:8"
msgid "This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 冒険者諸君には、特殊な香の素材の確保を依頼したい。<br>クラウドトラップを倒し、「雲海妖花の花粉」を確保されたし。
#. de: Wir bitten die Besatzung des Luftschiffs, einen speziellen Duftstoff zu besorgen. Erlegt dazu Wolkenfallen und erbeutet ihre Pollen!
#. fr: Nous avons besoin de matériaux pour préparer des pièges olfactifs. Localisez des piège-nuages puis abattez-les pour obtenir leur pollen.
#. column 7: Slay cloudtraps and obtain cloudblossom pollen
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:48:0:9"
msgid "House Haillenarte is on the lookout for unique-smelling substances─your first task will be to harvest pollen from the region's cloudtraps."
msgstr ""

#. ja: また、任務の過程では、「活動評価」を指針として、周辺の探索も進めてもらいたい。
#. de: Im Übrigen habe ich nichts dagegen, wenn ihr euch auch um andere Aufgaben kümmert. Wir können jede Hilfe gebrauchen!
#. fr: Toute autre découverte sur l'archipel pouvant se révéler utile, nous vous invitons également à explorer les environs durant votre mission pour obtenir une meilleure évaluation.
#. column 7: Slay cloudtraps and obtain cloudblossom pollen
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 9: House Haillenarte is on the lookout for unique-smelling substances─your first task will be to harvest pollen from the region's cloudtraps.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:48:0:10"
msgid "This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「フラッドウォーム」を倒し、「ウォームの肝」を収集
#. de: Flutwürmer besiegen und Lebern erbeuten
#. fr: Éliminer des vers diluviens et obtenir leur foie
#. column 8: Operation Command here.<br>We have received your preliminary report.
#. column 9: Next on the list of strangely scented materials is the liver of a flood worm. Lovely.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:49:0:7"
msgid "Slay flood worms and obtain worm livers"
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制……<br>探索任務の第一段階完了を確認した。
#. de: Hier Kommandozentrale Haillenarte. Wir bestätigen den Abschluss der ersten Etappe der Expedition.
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Première partie de la mission d'exploration terminée.
#. column 7: Slay flood worms and obtain worm livers
#. column 9: Next on the list of strangely scented materials is the liver of a flood worm. Lovely.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:49:0:8"
msgid "Operation Command here.<br>We have received your preliminary report."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 引き続き、香の素材となる物資を集めてくれ。<br>フラッドウォームを倒し、「ウォームの肝」を確保されたし。
#. de: Wir bitten die Besatzung des Luftschiffs nun, einen speziellen Duftstoff zu besorgen. Erlegt dazu Flutwürmer und erbeutet ihre Lebern!
#. fr: Nous avons besoin d'autres matériaux pour préparer des pièges olfactifs. Localisez des vers diluviens puis abattez-les pour obtenir leur foie.
#. column 7: Slay flood worms and obtain worm livers
#. column 8: Operation Command here.<br>We have received your preliminary report.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
