#. ja: バウンティ号の漂着地のアインハルト家の飛空士に収集物を納品
#. de: Ressourcen beim Piloten der <i>Bounty</i> abliefern
#. fr: Apporter les échan<shy>til<shy>lons au pilote des Haillenarte,<br>sur La Bonté
#. column 8: Operation Command here.<br>We have received your interim report.
#. column 9: Gather your last haul of goods and deliver what you have to the <i>Bounty</i>.
#. column 10: I promise you House Haillenarte will not be miserly with its gratitude!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:50:0:7"
msgid "Deliver gathered goods to the pilot at the <i>Bounty</i>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制……<br>探索任務の第二段階完了を確認した。
#. de: Hier Kommandozentrale Haillenarte. Wir bestätigen den Abschluss der zweiten Etappe der Expedition.
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Seconde partie de la mission d'exploration terminée.
#. column 7: Deliver gathered goods to the pilot at the <i>Bounty</i>
#. column 9: Gather your last haul of goods and deliver what you have to the <i>Bounty</i>.
#. column 10: I promise you House Haillenarte will not be miserly with its gratitude!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:50:0:8"
msgid "Operation Command here.<br>We have received your interim report."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 最後に収集した品を、「バウンティ号の漂着地」にいる、<br>「アインハルト家の飛空士」に届けてくれ。
#. de: Bringt jetzt die gesammelten Ressourcen zum Piloten des Luftschiffs <i>Bounty</i>.
#. fr: Veuillez apporter les échan<shy>til<shy>lons récoltés à notre pilote qui se trouve sur La Bonté.
#. column 7: Deliver gathered goods to the pilot at the <i>Bounty</i>
#. column 8: Operation Command here.<br>We have received your interim report.
#. column 10: I promise you House Haillenarte will not be miserly with its gratitude!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:50:0:9"
msgid "Gather your last haul of goods and deliver what you have to the <i>Bounty</i>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 諸君たちの協力に感謝する。<br>報酬は、漂着地で受渡をさせてもらうぞ！
#. de: Das Haus Haillenarte dankt euch für eure Hilfe. Ihr habt einen großen Dienst geleistet. Der Pilot wurde angewiesen, euch eure Belohnung auszuhändigen.
#. fr: Merci pour votre col<shy>la<shy>bo<shy>ra<shy>tion<nbsp>! Vous pouvez venir recevoir votre récompense à bord de La Bonté.
#. column 7: Deliver gathered goods to the pilot at the <i>Bounty</i>
#. column 8: Operation Command here.<br>We have received your interim report.
#. column 9: Gather your last haul of goods and deliver what you have to the <i>Bounty</i>.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:50:0:10"
msgid "I promise you House Haillenarte will not be miserly with its gratitude!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: バウンティ号の漂着地のアインハルト家の飛空士から試薬を調達
#. de: Ressourcen beim Piloten der <i>Bounty</i> abliefern
#. fr: Recevoir les potions de la part du pilote des Haillenarte, sur La Bonté
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 9: Your task this day will be to field test a new reagent developed to enfeeble the fierce beasts of the Diadem.
#. column 10: First things first! Make your way to the <i>Bounty</i> and collect the elixir we have prepared.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:51:0:7"
msgid "Accept the enfeebling elixir from the pilot at the <i>Bounty</i>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制、貴船の進入を確認した。<br>ようこそ、ディアデム諸島へ！
#. de: Hier Kommandozentrale Haillenarte. An das eingetroffene Luftschiff: Willkommen auf dem Diadem!
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Position de votre aéronef confirmée sur nos radars. Bienvenue dans l'archipel du Diadème<nbsp>!
#. column 7: Accept the enfeebling elixir from the pilot at the <i>Bounty</i>
#. column 9: Your task this day will be to field test a new reagent developed to enfeeble the fierce beasts of the Diadem.
#. column 10: First things first! Make your way to the <i>Bounty</i> and collect the elixir we have prepared.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:51:0:8"
msgid "This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 冒険者諸君には、強力な生物への対抗手段として、<br>開発中の試薬の実証試験を依頼したい。
#. de: Das Haus Haillenarte bittet die Besatzung des Luftschiffs, ein Schwächungsmittel zur Beseitigung hochgefährlicher Ungeheuer zu testen.
#. fr: Nous voulons ex<shy>pé<shy>ri<shy>men<shy>ter un nouveau produit affaiblissant sur les monstres de l'archipel.
#. column 7: Accept the enfeebling elixir from the pilot at the <i>Bounty</i>
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 10: First things first! Make your way to the <i>Bounty</i> and collect the elixir we have prepared.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:51:0:9"
msgid "Your task this day will be to field test a new reagent developed to enfeeble the fierce beasts of the Diadem."
msgstr ""

#. ja: まずは「バウンティ号の漂着地」を訪れ、<br>「アインハルト家の飛空士」から試薬を入手されたし。
#. de: Begebt euch zuerst zur <i>Bounty</i> und lasst euch vom Piloten das Schwächungsmittel aushändigen.
#. fr: Commencez par vous rendre à bord de La Bonté pour recevoir les potions de la part de notre pilote.
#. column 7: Accept the enfeebling elixir from the pilot at the <i>Bounty</i>
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 9: Your task this day will be to field test a new reagent developed to enfeeble the fierce beasts of the Diadem.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:51:0:10"
msgid "First things first! Make your way to the <i>Bounty</i> and collect the elixir we have prepared."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「シルバーシェル」に「弱化の試薬」を用いて討伐
#. de: Silberschalen mit Debilitans schwächen und besiegen
#. fr: Affaiblir des coquargents avec une potion anémiante puis les vaincre
#. column 8: Your task now is to test the enfeebling elixir in combat against silvershells.
#. column 9: The exact timing is left to your discretion, but do be sure to use the elixir before the creatures are dead, eh?
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:52:0:7"
msgid "Slay silvershells weakened by the enfeebling elixir"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「シルバーシェル」に対して「弱化の試薬」を使用し、<br>その上で討伐を試みてもらいたい。
#. de: Achtung, Luftschiffbesatzung! Silberschalen mit Debilitans schwächen und ausschalten!
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Affaiblissez des coquargents grâce à une potion anémiante puis abattez-les.
#. column 7: Slay silvershells weakened by the enfeebling elixir
#. column 9: The exact timing is left to your discretion, but do be sure to use the elixir before the creatures are dead, eh?
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:52:0:8"
msgid "Your task now is to test the enfeebling elixir in combat against silvershells."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 試薬を使うタイミングは、冒険者諸君に任せる。<br>だが、実証試験であるため、確実に使用した上で討伐するように。
#. de: Ich überlasse es euch, wie und wann ihr das Schwächungsmittel einsetzt. Aber es muss getestet werden.
#. fr: Nous laissons la méthode d'utilisation à votre discrétion. Assurez-vous cependant de constater l'effet du produit.
#. column 7: Slay silvershells weakened by the enfeebling elixir
#. column 8: Your task now is to test the enfeebling elixir in combat against silvershells.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:52:0:9"
msgid "The exact timing is left to your discretion, but do be sure to use the elixir before the creatures are dead, eh?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: また、任務の過程では、「活動評価」を指針として、周辺の探索も進めてもらいたい。
#. de: Im Übrigen habe ich nichts dagegen, wenn ihr euch auch um andere Aufgaben kümmert. Wir können jede Hilfe gebrauchen!
#. fr: Toute autre découverte sur l'archipel pouvant se révéler utile, nous vous invitons également à explorer les environs durant votre mission pour obtenir une meilleure évaluation.
