#. ja: 誘引香の罠で「ディアデム・マーリド」を誘き寄せて討伐
#. de: Diadem-Marids anlocken und besiegen
#. fr: Attirer des marids du Diadème avec un piège olfactif puis les vaincre
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 9: These isles crawl with deadly denizens, and it will be your task to thin their numbers. Head to the hunting ground we've indicated, then lure your targets into an ambush.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:95:0:7"
msgid "Use a scent trap to ambush Diadem marids"
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制、貴船の進入を確認した。<br>ようこそ、ディアデム諸島へ！
#. de: Hier Kommandozentrale Haillenarte. An das eingetroffene Luftschiff: Willkommen auf dem Diadem!
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte. Position de votre aéronef confirmée sur nos radars. Bienvenue dans l'archipel du Diadème<nbsp>!
#. column 7: Use a scent trap to ambush Diadem marids
#. column 9: These isles crawl with deadly denizens, and it will be your task to thin their numbers. Head to the hunting ground we've indicated, then lure your targets into an ambush.
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:95:0:8"
msgid "This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 冒険者諸君には、危険生物の駆除を依頼したい。<br>目標地点で「誘引香の罠」を使い、標的を誘き寄せて倒せ。
#. de: Das Haus Haillenarte bittet die Besatzung des Luftschiffs, bei der Sicherung der Inseln zu assistieren. Zündet am angegebenen Ort eine Duftfalle und beseitigt die erscheinenden Ungeheuer!
#. fr: Nous voulons que vous éliminiez les créatures qui mettent en danger nos équipes d'exploration. Activez le piège olfactif à l'endroit indiqué pour attirer des marids du Diadème puis abattez-les.
#. column 7: Use a scent trap to ambush Diadem marids
#. column 8: This is Operation Command─we see your ship has arrived safely. Welcome to the Diadem!
#. column 10: This operation's degree of success will also be gauged by the extent of your explorations. Have at it, adventurers.
msgctxt "SkyIsland2MissionDetail:95:0:9"
msgid "These isles crawl with deadly denizens, and it will be your task to thin their numbers. Head to the hunting ground we've indicated, then lure your targets into an ambush."
msgstr ""

#. ja: また、任務の過程では、「活動評価」を指針として、周辺の探索も進めてもらいたい。
#. de: Im Übrigen habe ich nichts dagegen, wenn ihr euch auch um andere Aufgaben kümmert. Wir können jede Hilfe gebrauchen!
#. fr: Toute autre découverte sur l'archipel pouvant se révéler utile, nous vous invitons également à explorer les environs durant votre mission pour obtenir une meilleure évaluation.
#. column 7: Use a scent trap to ambush Diadem marids
